<title>CANADA: Gulfstream sets European share offering.</title>
<headline>Gulfstream sets European share offering.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gulfstream Resources Canada Ltd said on Tuesday that it is placing 2,500,000 common shares at a price of C$15 per share with European investors.</p>
<p>Investors also have the right to buy an additional 500,000 common shares up to the close of business on January 15, 1997, Gulfstream said.</p>
<p>Proceeds will be used to support the company's ongoing development activities in Qatar and other areas, Gulfstream said.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
</text>
